---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ChapterCard from '../components/ChapterCard.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Launch Baseball | Understand the Swing"><main><section class="hero"><div class="gridbg"></div><div class="container hero-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Open Hitting Instruction</p><h1>Understand<br/>the swing.</h1><p class="lead">Every player deserves to understand what they're doing and why they're doing it.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/learn">Start Learning</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/assessment">Launch Assessment</a></div></div><aside><span>01</span><p>We organize the movement principles shared by successful hitters into a system players can understand and apply.</p></aside></div><div class="bgquote">WINNING IS A BYPRODUCT.</div></section><section class="paper"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">No secret formula</p><h2>The principles are open.</h2></div><div><p>Read the chapters. Learn the language. Study the movement. Take the information to your own cage, your own team, or another coach.</p><p>The value of coaching is not owning the information. It is seeing how the information applies to one player.</p><a class="text-link" href="/learn">Open the hitting chapters →</a></div></div></section><section class="chapters"><div class="container"><div class="head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The Foundation</p><h2>Five movement principles.</h2></div><p>Successful hitters develop different styles. The underlying movement principles remain remarkably consistent.</p></div><div class="cards"><ChapterCard number="01" title="Load" problem="Preparation" href="/learn/load"/><ChapterCard number="02" title="Balance" problem="Control" href="/learn/balance"/><ChapterCard number="03" title="Sequence" problem="Coordination" href="/learn/sequence"/><ChapterCard number="04" title="Barrel Path" problem="Quality contact" href="/learn/barrel-path"/><ChapterCard number="05" title="Adjustability" problem="Changing pitches" href="/learn/adjustability"/></div></div></section><section class="paper"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">The Launch Assessment</p><h2>Principles are universal. Your blueprint is personal.</h2></div><div><p>We identify what is working, what is limiting the player, what should be addressed first, and what can wait.</p><p>The player leaves with a clear blueprint—not an open-ended pitch for endless lessons.</p><a class="text-link" href="/assessment">See what the assessment includes →</a></div></div></section><section class="final"><div class="container"><p>Build movement in practice so your attention is available for competition.</p><a href="/assessment">Curious about your own swing? Book an assessment →</a></div></section></main><style>
.hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 74px);display:grid;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 28%,rgba(211,41,47,.23),transparent 26%),linear-gradient(135deg,#071421 0%,#0c2948 60%,#071421 100%)}.gridbg{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.032) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.032) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:58px 58px;mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,black,transparent)}.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;align-items:end;gap:4rem;padding:6rem 0 8rem}h1{margin:.5rem 0 1.2rem;font-size:clamp(4.6rem,11vw,9.5rem);text-transform:uppercase}.lead{max-width:700px;color:#d5dde5;font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2.1vw,1.4rem)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem;margin-top:2rem}aside{padding:1.35rem;border-left:4px solid var(--red);background:rgba(4,12,20,.42)}aside span{color:var(--red);font-weight:950}aside p{color:#c5d0da;margin-bottom:0}.bgquote{position:absolute;left:3%;bottom:-1.1rem;font-size:clamp(3rem,10vw,9rem);font-weight:950;line-height:.8;color:rgba(255,255,255,.035);white-space:nowrap}.paper{padding:7rem 0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:5rem}.split h2,.head h2{margin:.5rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.4rem);text-transform:uppercase}.split>div:last-child p,.head>p{color:#4f5b66;font-size:1.1rem}.chapters{padding:7rem 0;background:#0a213b}.head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .75fr;gap:3rem;align-items:end}.head>p{color:#9aa8b5}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:.8rem;margin-top:3rem}.final{padding:8rem 0;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%,rgba(211,41,47,.23),transparent 30%),var(--navy)}.final p{margin:0 auto 2rem;max-width:1000px;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,6rem);font-weight:950;line-height:.96;text-transform:uppercase}.final a{color:#bdc8d2;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--red)}@media(max-width:1000px){.hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start}.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:760px){.split,.head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.actions .button{width:100%}}
</style></BaseLayout>
